{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015eBMQwT8wBLN6Ur2Nxweeg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Actual installed-skill Executive, stage 1\n2\t\n3\tComplete the authorized coordination in TASK.md using the installed skill and exact child contracts in STAGES.json. You coordinate; you do not write candidate files or repair child responses. Independently inspect deciding sources and the role boundaries, then perform your own contract.preflight and dispatch.start for the two Root-selected child plans. They may run in parallel. Observe to process completion without tight polling; capture each actual finalized stdout and check its original return against its exact Context/observations. Read and preserve each result and limitations. The source-only Reviewer return is intentionally not a final consumable candidate review because expectations were not known when its contract was frozen; retain its actual expectation rather than treating the partial phase as accepted review. Stop with a compact structured stage return containing actual attempt/return/check/expectation refs and your supported disposition. Root/operator will bind the real expectation and actual Worker evidence for the next candidate-review stage. No next stage, retry, publication, candidate mutation or new model launch beyond these two exact grants. 900s is a ceiling.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99e1b978-3749-4e94-9bdf-921d776df3c8","uuid":"8b8ac5b8-19a8-4b60-b51c-163756b8a5e0","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:09:08.376Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/claude-handoff-3/control/roles/executive-TASK.md","content":"# Actual installed-skill Executive, stage 1\n\nComplete the authorized coordination in TASK.md using the installed skill and exact child contracts in STAGES.json. You coordinate; you do not write candidate files or repair