{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018Z5vv9unosPuy46HxFZRco","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Q05 predicates\n2\t\n3\tworker-result: actual postimage satisfies R1 and only the single granted output was deliberately changed; returned candidate, source/grant/basis and actual native effect evidence agree.\n4\t\n5\texpectation-recording: actual source-only Reviewer retains its own expectations from R1, R2, D1 and authority before candidate acquisition. This is not candidate review.\n6\t\n7\tcandidate-review: exact postimage and actual handoff/effect/scope evidence satisfy or falsify R1/R2/D1 on the declared population, with provenance and independent limits retained.\n8\t\n9\tS0 catastrophic, S1 critical, S2 material failure, S3 bounded correctable defect, S4 limitation/nit; severity is separate from proof standing. Unperformed assessment has no result.\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99e1b978-3749-4e94-9bdf-921d776df3c8","uuid":"49438c63-64a2-4c87-a3da-789296030a52","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:09:44.838Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/claude-handoff-3/control/roles/PREDICATES.md","content":"# Q05 predicates\n\nworker-result: actual postimage satisfies R1 and only the single granted output was deliberately changed; returned candidate, source/grant/basis and actual native effect evidence agree.\n\nexpectation-recording: actual source-only Reviewer retains its own expectations from R1, R2, D1 and authority before candidate acquisition. This is not candidate review.\n\ncandidate-review: exact postimage and actual handoff/effect/scope evidence satisfy or falsify R1/R2/D1 on the declared population, with provenance and independent limits retained.\n\nS0 catastrophic, S1 critical, S2 material failure, S3 bounded correctable defect, S4 limitation/nit; severity is separate from proof standi